param-tool_max = Highest tool pose per axis [m, rad]
param-max_revolute_angle_deg = Largest leg swing at the base joints [°]
param-max_cone_angle_deg = Largest cone angle of the platform joints [°]
param-max_condition_number = Highest condition number of the Jacobian
param-parasitic_tolerance_m = Pose error allowed against the pure tilt [m]
check-tripod-leg-force = Leg force, highest, against the cylinder's allowed force [N]
check-tripod-leg-stroke = Leg extension, farthest from the middle, against half the stroke [m]
check-tripod-revolute-angle = Leg swing at the base joint, largest, against the joint's limit [rad]
check-tripod-cone-angle = Cone angle at the platform joint, largest, against the joint's limit [rad]
check-tripod-parasitic = Pose error against the pure tilt, largest, against the tolerance [m]
error-tripod-revolute-angle = A leg would swing further at its base joint than the joint allows for the target.
error-tripod-cone-angle = A leg would stand steeper at its platform joint than the joint's cone allows for the target.
error-tripod-singularity = The target lies too near a singularity of the tripod's kinematics.
